OL,3,GNEWSASinkhole repairs leave pub
OL,4,Alandlord frustrated
OL,5,
OL,6,FA landlord says a sinkhole on the main
OL,7,Froad outside his pub is hitting his
OL,8,Ftrade as it prevents deliveries getting
OL,9,Fto him and costs him more money.
OL,11,FAsh Holman is the manager of the Boat
OL,12,Fand Horses in Newcastle-under-Lyme,
OL,13,FStaffordshire, and said he would
OL,14,Ftypically receive a delivery from an
OL,15,Farticulated lorry once a week, carrying
OL,16,Ftwo tons of beer.
OL,18,FHe said he did not know when regular
OL,19,Fdeliveries would resume and it was
OL,20,Faffecting his business.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
