OL,3,GNEWSASinkhole repairs leave pub
OL,4,Alandlord frustrated
OL,5,
OL,6,FStaffordshire County Council said they
OL,7,Ftried to repair the road but the
OL,8,Fconcrete used ended up in the sewer
OL,9,Fnetwork and now Severn Trent Water have
OL,10,Ftaken over the repair effort.
